{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Fights in Tight Spaces: K-9 Division</strong>, Agent 11's recent successes have created an urgent demand for new muscle in the criminal underworld, a demand that an ambitious razor gang is all too happy to meet. Fortunately, Agent 11 is joined by a powerful new ally, able to help bring down this fresh threat to Section XI with a brand new movement and support attack system.  <br>  \u00a0</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An all-new assistant system with unique abilities and movements</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >50+ new cards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two new canine starter decks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Remixed story mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New enemies </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3625850/extras/003149f4e10b3f620e8f1ebea7075f64.poster.avif?t=1758816009\" width=1170 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3625850/extras/003149f4e10b3f620e8f1ebea7075f64.webm?t=1758816009\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3625850/extras/003149f4e10b3f620e8f1ebea7075f64.mp4?t=1758816009\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Equip Agent Eleven with a ruthless K-9 companion, introducing a brand-new set of cards, expanding the replayability of the core game.\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3625850/extras/1525e0df97da3e6ad08e267cc731d5d9.poster.avif?t=1758816009\" width=1170 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3625850/extra